## What Qualifies a Vehicle Under California Lemon Law?

- The manufacturer has made a reasonable number of attempts to repair the warranty-covered defect.

- The vehicle has been out of service for warranty-covered repairs for 30 cumulative days or more.

- The vehicle’s defects were not caused by driver abuse, accident, or lack of maintenance.

